-# Independent synthesis A
-
-Assignment 13 · COD-92 · 2026-09-30 UTC. Analytical delivery for independent review; no self-approval.
-
-**Verdict: revise the strategy, narrow the local hypothesis, leave paid coordination unresolved, and reject an automatic free-to-paid progression.** The strongest evidence-backed direction is to test whether Codeweb can remove the factual discovery step on a maintainer's actual ambiguous reuse or reference task. Keep normal source inspection, architecture judgment and behavioral checks explicit. A useful free inspection tool is an acceptable outcome. The evidence does not justify expanding into a memory platform or hosted business to overcome the brief's limited ceiling.
-
-This recommendation concerns the frozen proposal. It neither modifies the charter nor authorizes implementation, participant trials, outreach, purchases or release. The prepared proof sprint remains a proposal. Its native-host demonstration is a sensible first discriminating step under separate execution authority; new features are not a prerequisite unless an observed delivery defect prevents that test.
